{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2d822909-9712-8e1b-b511-301e7deb4834",
  "created_at": "2026-01-07T13:06:45-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Donna Lombardozzi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:02:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, Luis speaking. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:02:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Parking ticket. I got one, shouldn't have. Need to understand it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:02:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let's take a look. Do you have the ticket in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:02:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Says no resident permit displayed. Resident permit spot, Bridge Street. But I have the sticker. It's on the windshield. Right there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:02:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And what's the ticket number up in the corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:03:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um. Starts with a P. P, then... hold on. Four, four, one, nine, zero, two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:03:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "P four four one nine zero two. Got it, one second while I pull that up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:03:14-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:03:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I see it. Issued Monday morning, Bridge Street, violation is resident permit only zone. Where's the sticker on your car exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:03:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lower left of the windshield. Driver's side. Inside the glass."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:03:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is that the right place? Because I thought it was the other way. Maybe it's not. I'd have to check, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:03:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait. So is that the problem? The side? Nobody told me a side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:03:46-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm not saying that's it. I'm saying officers look for it in a certain spot and I don't have that in front of me. The appeal is the place to say you had a valid permit displayed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:04:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Appeal. Okay. Is that this department or a different one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:04:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The payment side is us. The appeal goes through the hearing process, and that's on the back of the ticket. There's a form and a deadline."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:04:18-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Back of the ticket. Hang on. [pause] Okay. It says contest by mail or in person. Which is it? Both?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:04:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either one works. Mail it in or bring it to City Hall. Include a photo of the sticker on your windshield. That helps a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:04:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A photo. Okay. Of the car or the sticker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:04:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both if you can. The whole windshield, then a close-up of the sticker so they can read the number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:04:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Does the ticket still go up while I wait? Like late fees?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:04:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you file the appeal in time, it generally gets held while it's reviewed. But don't let the date slide, because then it does start climbing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:05:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And if I lose. Is there a payment plan? Can't pay it all at once."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:05:15-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a way to set up payments for some balances. I can't promise the terms on this one without a supervisor looking at it. I can take your number and have someone call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:05:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. 401-555-0156."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:05:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one five six. And that's Donna?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:05:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Donna Lombardozzi. Two L's? No. Just one. L-O-M-B-A-R-D-O-Z-Z-I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:05:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Lombardozzi. Address on the registration, is that Bridge Street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:05:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. 415 Bridge Street. The Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:05:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 415 Bridge. Someone should call you back. Probably today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:05:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Today's hard. I have to be at the middle school at noon. For a hearing screening. Not for me. Well. Kind of. Anyway, I'm late already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:06:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then you'd better go. It's past one, though, so maybe you just got out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:06:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm? Oh. Wait. Noon was today? No, tomorrow. I mixed it up. It's Wednesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:06:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Wednesday. So you've got a whole day. Good for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:06:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so tomorrow noon. Sorry. So, photo, then mail or bring it in. And someone calls about the plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:06:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. And check the sticker's placement while you're at it. Might be nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:06:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I still don't get why it was ticketed. But fine. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T13:06:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Donna. Take care."
    }
  ],
